{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>English localization for the game is planned. Add it to your wishlist to show your support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/d283fa3e5ce3ce9d779e0234a37048e2.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the heroic tale of the 108 Liangshan heroes from Water Margin. Players travel from the modern era into the Water Margin universe, becoming the 109th hero. They will experience the love, hatred, schemes, and chaos of the Water Margin story, striving to achieve an outcome different from the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/c3d2134510a41f88a38eda900b012996.avif?t=1764316707\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras_big/c3d2134510a41f88a38eda900b012996.webp?t=1764316707 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/71a4248aeb590273e49168fc0f2ddcd4.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key decisions in the game will determine which heroes you ally with, which storylines you enter, and ultimately shape your stance within the Liangshan factions and the game\u2019s ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/99b7f81e4336149cadda65a6cd1d0baa.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/0775d5cca53771b70ba3841e77813b2a.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore a world composed of an over-world map and regional maps. By passing attribute checks, they can trigger interactions, take on side quests, and encounter random events. Exploring key areas will advance the main plot and unlock different story developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/c5877d5188596f164a93ab373ed3cbc4.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/a8cd5e72969fab67fa2131323bc3a78e.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can participate in the stories of different Liangshan heroes, such as Lin Chong, Wu Song, Lu Zhishen, and others. By befriending them and meeting certain conditions, players can  form a team with these heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/0c3881956a96316f34d219781cd99a9f.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/fd31a6088b785707270a207e2cadf057.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of key Water Margin heroes can be recruited into your squad. Each hero\u2019s combat style and abilities can be deeply customized, including allocating attribute and specialization points upon leveling up, equipping unique weapons with innate skills, and utilizing hero cards that provide bonus effects. Other heroes can also offer assistance through various in-game systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/5eaeff481dcd9bd529a70ef3f1e3caa7.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewriting the ending of &quot;Water Margin&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple playthroughs and branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the heroes of Water Margin and save them from their tragic fates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and grow alongside the heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the intricate power struggles among the forces of Liangshan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn woodblock print art style</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914030?t=1764316707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3914030?t=1764316707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/91d90452e9d22b9c1a902a63a8817427fc7c213c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764316707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/91d90452e9d22b9c1a902a63a8817427fc7c213c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764316707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>English localization for the game is planned. Add it to your wishlist to show your support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/d283fa3e5ce3ce9d779e0234a37048e2.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the heroic tale of the 108 Liangshan heroes from Water Margin. Players travel from the modern era into the Water Margin universe, becoming the 109th hero. They will experience the love, hatred, schemes, and chaos of the Water Margin story, striving to achieve an outcome different from the original.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/c3d2134510a41f88a38eda900b012996.avif?t=1764316707\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras_big/c3d2134510a41f88a38eda900b012996.webp?t=1764316707 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/71a4248aeb590273e49168fc0f2ddcd4.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key decisions in the game will determine which heroes you ally with, which storylines you enter, and ultimately shape your stance within the Liangshan factions and the game\u2019s ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/99b7f81e4336149cadda65a6cd1d0baa.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/0775d5cca53771b70ba3841e77813b2a.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can explore a world composed of an over-world map and regional maps. By passing attribute checks, they can trigger interactions, take on side quests, and encounter random events. Exploring key areas will advance the main plot and unlock different story developments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/c5877d5188596f164a93ab373ed3cbc4.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/a8cd5e72969fab67fa2131323bc3a78e.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players can participate in the stories of different Liangshan heroes, such as Lin Chong, Wu Song, Lu Zhishen, and others. By befriending them and meeting certain conditions, players can  form a team with these heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/0c3881956a96316f34d219781cd99a9f.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/fd31a6088b785707270a207e2cadf057.avif?t=1764316707\" width=587 height=145 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of key Water Margin heroes can be recruited into your squad. Each hero\u2019s combat style and abilities can be deeply customized, including allocating attribute and specialization points upon leveling up, equipping unique weapons with innate skills, and utilizing hero cards that provide bonus effects. Other heroes can also offer assistance through various in-game systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/extras/5eaeff481dcd9bd529a70ef3f1e3caa7.avif?t=1764316707\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewriting the ending of &quot;Water Margin&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple playthroughs and branching storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the heroes of Water Margin and save them from their tragic fates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and grow alongside the heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the intricate power struggles among the forces of Liangshan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique hand-drawn woodblock print art style</p></li></ul>","developers":["\u7a77\u67e5\u7406\u7684\u5e7b\u60f3"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/52aca5dbcf69e1993df984d3f358e6041ec3be8a/header.jpg?t=1764316707","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The 109th Hero","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 980<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["\u7a77\u67e5\u7406\u7684\u5e7b\u60f3"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914030/983c4571860b162838c98f4ed0622c449a015cce/ss_983c4571860b162838c98f4ed0622c449a015cce.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764316707","